{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Curse Legion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will play as the progenitor of vampires, leading your Blood Curse Legion to sweep across the world, establishing a vampire nation and dominating a region.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game supports up to 4 players, with both cooperative and competitive modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players mainly control the vampire cavalry legion in combat, changing their formation according to different situations to maximize damage output and customize support formations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.poster.avif?t=1773033778\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.webm?t=1773033778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.mp4?t=1773033778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero units: Heroes have random attributes, providing a different game experience each time. They are generally 4 types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich skill selection allows you to customize the growth direction of your heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of troops:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spear infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying troops</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own vampire castle: You can construct multi-layered castles and decorate them with loot. Castles cannot be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build front-line fortresses to block enemy attacks. Note that front-line fortresses can be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment and Craft system: You can combine weapons and other important items.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529010?t=1773033778","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773033778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/d9a93a4d4e97b21ed0704af84588b3aba0615f51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773033778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/d9a93a4d4e97b21ed0704af84588b3aba0615f51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773033778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Curse Legion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will play as the progenitor of vampires, leading your Blood Curse Legion to sweep across the world, establishing a vampire nation and dominating a region.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game supports up to 4 players, with both cooperative and competitive modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players mainly control the vampire cavalry legion in combat, changing their formation according to different situations to maximize damage output and customize support formations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.poster.avif?t=1773033778\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.webm?t=1773033778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.mp4?t=1773033778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero units: Heroes have random attributes, providing a different game experience each time. They are generally 4 types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich skill selection allows you to customize the growth direction of your heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of troops:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spear infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying troops</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own vampire castle: You can construct multi-layered castles and decorate them with loot. Castles cannot be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build front-line fortresses to block enemy attacks. Note that front-line fortresses can be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment and Craft system: You can combine weapons and other important items.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cocolaugh"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/ca39cb75c884b1dfb36c30e1dce2f2cc05d583c8/header.jpg?t=1773033778","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3529010/792688767/4c339f37c089257bc2bab59198bbfa13f5d74fcf/1750858473/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748660954","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3529010/792688767/4c339f37c089257bc2bab59198bbfa13f5d74fcf/1750858473/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748660954","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3529010/792688767/4c339f37c089257bc2bab59198bbfa13f5d74fcf/1750858473/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748660954","id":257148729,"name":" \u7cbe\u5f69\u96c6\u4e2d\u524d\u7f6eV2-20250531","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148729/c6b8a30304afda6fb0f1f921734aa6a97b47f03f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748660954"}],"name":"Blood Curse Legions","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","recommende