ocolaugh@hotmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Greek, Japanese, Polish, Swedish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Romanian, Finnish, Dutch, Portuguese - Portugal, Arabic, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":"https://x.com/CocoLaugh"}